{"3452910": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Varjomana", "steam_appid": 3452910, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Death-worshipping cult is plunging the world into darkness by using <i>Varjomana</i> to resurrect the dead, but they made a huge mistake: <strong>THEY RESURRECTED ALSO YOU</strong>, an ancient battlemage. Once forgotten, now reborn.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Step into the chaotic realm of <i>Varjomana</i>, a high-adrenaline, retro-inspired shooter. Harness the power of dual-wield magic, where each hand operates independently.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fight a death-worshipping cult bent on raising the dead and plunging the world into eternal darkness. With tight controls, lightning-fast gameplay, and a vibrant retro aesthetic, <i>Varjomana </i>throws you back into the golden era of FPS games. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Key Features:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Speedrun Friendly</strong>: Arcade-style movement and fast pacing make it ideal for speedrunning.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3452910/extras/7aeae1bbfd37f9cacb4359c2595f0394.poster.avif?t=1737890293\" width=616 height=262 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3452910/extras/7aeae1bbfd37f9cacb4359c2595f0394.webm?t=1737890293\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3452910/extras/7aeae1bbfd37f9cacb4359c2595f0394.mp4?t=1737890293\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>1990s Retro Style</strong>: Low poly art and nostalgic soundscapes transport you to the golden age of shooters.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Spellcasting Freedom</strong>: Wield independent spells in both hands to solve each situation by your own way.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3452910/extras/4635502a355edaf4a8a8b5f9a97a1cde.poster.avif?t=1737890293\" width=616 height=236 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3452910/extras/4635502a355edaf4a8a8b5f9a97a1cde.webm?t=1737890293\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3452910/extras/4635502a355edaf4a8a8b5f9a97a1cde.mp4?t=1737890293\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Perfect your spells, speed up your movement, and become the shadow that stands against the darkness!</p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Death-worshipping cult is plunging the world into darkness by using <i>Varjomana</i> to resurrect the dead, but they made a huge mistake: <strong>THEY RESURRECTED ALSO YOU</strong>, an ancient battlemage. Once forgotten, now reborn.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Step into the chaotic realm of <i>Varjomana</i>, a high-adrenaline, retro-inspired shooter. Harness the power of dual-wield magic, where each hand operates independently.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fight a death-worshipping cult bent on raising the dead and plunging the world into eternal darkness. With tight controls, lightning-fast gameplay, and a vibrant retro aesthetic, <i>Varjomana </i>throws you back into the golden era of FPS games. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Key Features:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Speedrun Friendly</strong>: Arcade-style movement and fast pacing make it ideal for speedrunning.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3452910/extras/7aeae1bbfd37f9cacb4359c2595f0394.poster.avif?t=1737890293\" width=616 height=262 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3452910/extras/7aeae1bbfd37f9cacb4359c2595f0394.webm?t=1737890293\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3452910/extras/7aeae1bbfd37f9cacb4359c2595f0394.mp4?t=1737890293\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>1990s Retro Style</strong>: Low poly art and nostalgic soundscapes transport you to the golden age of shooters.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Spellcasting Freedom</strong>: Wield independent spells in both hands to solve each situation by your own way.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3452910/extras/4635502a355edaf4a8a8b5f9a97a1cde.poster.avif?t=1737890293\" width=616 height=236 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3452910/extras/4635502a355edaf4a8a8b5f9a97a1cde.webm?t=1737890293\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3452910/extras/4635502a355edaf4a8a8b5f9a97a1cde.mp4?t=1737890293\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Perfect your spells, speed up your movement, and become the shadow that stands against the darkness!</p>", "short_description": "Enter a dark fantasy world inspired by retro shooters! Varjomana is a fast-paced spellcasting FPS where each hand wields independent magic, offering unparalleled speedrunning potential. Master powerful spells and lightning-fast movement to fight a sinister cult.", "support